        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/d26b3c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2022-08-10T13:11:50.496Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Sea-Envy\" data-post=\"17\" data-topic=\"29499\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/48/1849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Sea-Envy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>For the Alien aspect compared to Muppets how about Doug Jones as Tempest?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Reminds me of one of the “replace everyone except one human with Muppets” discussion on Twitter. My suggestion was Empire Strikes Back, with the human being Frank Oz (himself, not as a puppeteer) playing Yoda.</p>",
