      {
        "id": 250058,
        "name": "",
        "username": "The_Justifier",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-12-19T03:10:48.043Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well he has a blind spot for his employment, obviously.  I wouldn’t call him dumb in general, just with respect to that particular subject.  Heavily invested in something that he depends on to help define his very identity, to say nothing of his economic lifestyle and the future he hopes to build for himself, he turns a blind eye to things he probably should be taking more seriously.  Even very smart people are capable of such willful ignorance, around things which they’re emotionally dependent upon.</p>",
