      {
        "id": 264808,
        "name": "",
        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-01-12T19:01:12.717Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Christopher’s dead business partner is a Paultergeist.</p>\n<p>A good way to think of OblivAeon empowering infinite copies of un-singular scions: they don’t subtract power from him, they just mirror a fraction of the power inside him without taking anything out.  He’s not a battery being drained, he’s a huge Tesla coil driving multiple tiny generators.</p>\n<p>It would have worked, but also, consider the price.</p>\n<p>What exactly is a distinction between tuning out tinnitus versus forgetting you’re hearing it?</p>\n<p>I feel like the cave water was in more danger from Christopher’s blood than vice versa.  Someone should probably go there and check to make sure that all the blind cave fish haven’t been replaced with miniature Christopher clones armed with tiny spears made from the fish ribs.</p>",
        "post_number": 32,
        "post_type": 1,
